  "content_text": "我高興地報告，我們第三季度的交付項目已提前完成。\n[I'm pleased to report that we're ahead of schedule on the Q3 deliverables.]\n不過，整合測試階段比預期花更多時間，所以我哋可能需要調配額外資源。\n[That said, the integration testing phase is taking longer than expected, so we may need to allocate additional resources.]\n老實說，我對依賴第三方 API 有點擔心——那邊有任何延遲都會引發連鎖反應。\n[Honestly, I'm a bit concerned about the dependency on the third-party API — any delay there will cascade.]\n我哋朝早傾吓，重新評估時間表，決定係要升級定係調整範圍。\n[Let's sync tomorrow morning to reassess the timeline and decide whether to escalate or adjust the scope.]",
