          "start_time": 27.168,
          "end_time": 27.168,
          "language": "yue"
        },
        {
          "text": "That said, the integration testing phase is taking longer than expected, so we may need to allocate additional resources.",
          "start_time": 5.784,
          "end_time": 13.176,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 27.168,
          "end_time": 27.168,
          "language": "yue"
        },
        {
          "text": "老實說，我對依賴第三方 API 有點擔心——那邊有任何延遲都會引發連鎖反應。",
          "start_time": 13.176,
          "end_time": 20.544,
          "language": "yue"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 27.168,
          "end_time": 27.168,
          "language": "yue"
        },
        {
          "text": "Honestly, I'm a bit concerned about the dependency on the third-party API — any delay there will cascade.",
          "start_time": 13.176,
          "end_time": 20.544,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 27.168,
          "end_time": 27.168,
          "language": "yue"
        },
        {
          "text": "我哋朝早傾吓，重新評估時間表，決定係要升級定係調整範圍。",
